<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>FormGen</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="bulma.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="input.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="persona-landing">
    <main class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <h1 class="title is-3">FormGen</h1>
        <p class="subtitle is-5">A risk assessment workspace.</p>
      </header>

      <section class="landing-intro stack-md">
        <p>
          FormGen helps an organisation assess risks for the systems it
          builds and runs. The tool is split into three views, each for a
          different person in the loop — the system owner who knows what
          their system does, the risk assessor who judges the residual
          risks, and the executive or board member who keeps oversight of
          the register.
        </p>
        <p>
          Pick the view that matches your role. Your work is saved in your
          browser as you go, and you can export it as JSON to share with
          others.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="tool-cards">
        <a class="tool-card tool-card-questionnaire" href="questionnaire.html">
          <h2 class="title is-5">Questionnaire</h2>
          <p class="tool-card-persona">For system owners.</p>
          <p class="tool-card-blurb">
            Describe your system by answering a series of questions. Save
            your progress and export the answers when you're done.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-card-cta">Open questionnaire →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="tool-card tool-card-assessment" href="assessment.html">
          <h2 class="title is-5">Assessment</h2>
          <p class="tool-card-persona">For risk assessors.</p>
          <p class="tool-card-blurb">
            Load a system owner's answers and judge the inherent risks,
            control effectiveness, and residual risks. Export the
            assessment when complete.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-card-cta">Open assessment →</span>
        </a>

        <a class="tool-card tool-card-registry" href="registry.html">
          <h2 class="title is-5">Registry</h2>
          <p class="tool-card-persona">For executives and oversight.</p>
          <p class="tool-card-blurb">
            Browse system cards and risk assessments across the
            organisation.
          </p>
          <span class="tool-card-cta">Open registry →</span>
        </a>
      </section>
      {% include "_footer.html.j2" %}
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
